Z||000007||loafer87gt||12-18-2001||03:45 PM||||One of the guys over at Simhq said that IL-2 is already in the bargain bins at EB. You'll love the final game, it runs a lot more smoother on my machine (T-bird with plain GeForce256), and the sound is incredible. There is a lot of neat touches in the final game, I'll just list a couple. WHen you attack planes hauling around a bunch of ordinance, you can attack from the bottom and if you get a lucky cannon strike you can detonate their munitions, and the absolute best thing about the final version is the FW190. Talk about firepower! I was suprised to find it worked quite well in ground attack missions. Here is a couple of screengrabs I have taken.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.members.shaw.ca/loafer/Misc/snap.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.members.shaw.ca/loafer/Misc/snap2.jpg"> <P>The p39 is still my favorite. I am in the process of making a P47 for use in the game, I am currently in the process of building the cockpit model.||||reg||1
